{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29850","headline":"燕台四首 夏 · 李商隐","name":"燕台四首 夏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前阁雨帘愁不卷，後堂芳树阴阴见。\n石城景物类黄泉，夜半行郎空柘弹。\n绫扇唤风阊阖天，轻帷翠幕波渊旋。\n蜀魂寂寞有伴未，几夜瘴花开木棉。\n桂宫留影光难取，嫣薰兰破轻轻语。\n直教银汉堕怀中，未遣星妃镇来去。\n浊水清波何异源，济河水清黄河浑。\n安得簿雾起缃裙，手接云軿呼太君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}